"Did the contractor key used at the side door log or record use anywhere on the disputed dates?",
"Were the Gate 3 reader outage dates confirmed by the controller replacement record, and was the outage reported to the client or to Hartwell's supervisor at the time?",
"Were the lift 2 call-out tickets or client-side fault logs created for each disputed call-out, and when were they opened and closed?",
